{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 5Min Space Battle, players drive different fighters in cosmic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eliminate waves of enemies to gain EXP, upgrade weapons, and confront the final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Freedom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple fighter classes with distinct combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Covers: Ballistics | Lasers | Drones | Shields | Repair Systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Randomization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random enemy/boss spawns create dynamic battles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ensuring unique 5-minute combat experiences every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rapidly destroy enemies to maximize EXP gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make strategic upgrade choices to conquer randomized final bosses.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759210?t=1751594641","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759210?t=1751594641","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759210/dbb0ffe9918e63216a891197ec1ebc7c9dbc362b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751594641","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759210/dbb0ffe9918e63216a891197ec1ebc7c9dbc362b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751594641","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 5Min Space Battle, players drive different fighters in cosmic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eliminate waves of enemies to gain EXP, upgrade weapons, and confront the final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Freedom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple fighter classes with distinct combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Covers: Ballistics | Lasers | Dro